<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Namibian Sea posts half year loss, no div.</title>
<headline>Namibian Sea posts half year loss, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million Namibian dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     4.6 loss    vs 4.6 profit</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 nil	   vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.31 loss   vs 5.05 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.05 loss   vs 6.83 profit</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.23	  vs 1.30</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.03	  vs 0.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		  77.36	 vs 39.12</p>
<p>Full name: Namibian Sea Products Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Namibia's Namsea said it had been hit by the total absence of pilchards during the period set aside for catching.</p>
<p>It added that industrial fish catches had been on a par with last year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
